          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Ven3i",
              "name": "Para 1",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Astro 的岛屿架构，简单说就是「默认不加载 JavaScript」。页面在构建时就被渲染成静态 HTML，只有你显式标记的交互组件，才会在浏览器里被激活成一座座独立的小岛。",
              "lineHeight": 1.9,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "g3RXC",
              "name": "Heading 2",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "为什么值得用",
              "fontFamily": "$font-display",
              "fontSize": 30,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "OLj1f",
              "name": "Para 2",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "对博客这类以内容为主的站点，它几乎是最优解：首屏快、SEO 友好、分享卡片正常，而需要交互的地方（比如工具或小游戏）依然可以用 Vue 组件写。",
              "lineHeight": 1.9,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "LlhAH",
              "name": "Code Block",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$ink",
